 "remarks": "Spectacular Views, Spacious Living, and Exceptional Convenience! Perched on the 14th floor, this sun-filled 3-bedroom, 3-bath corner residence offers breathtaking city, sunset, and Long Island Sound views from two private balconies. Expansive windows brighten the generous living and dining areas, creating an inviting space for relaxing or entertaining. The eat-in kitchen features granite countertops, abundant cabinetry, and casual dining space. The oversized primary suite boasts a walk-in closet and private bath, while the second bedroom offers its own en-suite bath. A versatile third bedroom is ideal for guests or a home office. Enjoy assigned garage parking, private storage, and complimentary fitness center access. Building amenities include front desk reception, superintendent, community room, guest parking, outdoor pool, and convenient same-floor laundry. Heat, hot water, and cooking gas are included in common charges. Just minutes from downtown Stamford, Metro-North, I-95, shopping, restaurants, parks, and beaches. Experience elevated living with incredible views and everyday convenience! CASH BUYERS ONLY.",
